Description: Fits Bayesian additive regression trees (BART), a Bayesian
    nonparametric machine-learning method, for regression and classification.
    Provides posterior inference, credible and prediction intervals, variable
    selection, interaction analysis, partial-dependence plots,
    cross-validation, and optional graphics processing unit (GPU)
    acceleration through TornadoVM.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 2.14.0)
Imports: bartMachineJARs (>= 1.2.3), rJava, randomForest, missForest, stats, ggplot2, grid, checkmate, matrixStats, grDevices
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), withr
SystemRequirements: Java (>= 21.0), TornadoVM (if you want GPU optimization)
